<title>BELGIUM: Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.24 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.24 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg statistics office Statec released the following data on inflation -</p>
<p>    LUXEMBOURG CONSUMER PRICES February *  January   Feb 1996</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1996)	 100.85     101.04     n/a</p>
<p>    Mo/Mo change (in pct)	  -0.19	 0.30     n/a</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (in pct)	   1.24	 1.54     n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - * Luxembourg statistics office measures consumer price index on the first of the month. Index measured on March 1 is March inflation. April 1 index to be published on April 30.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
